{2}=3-4\\text{i},$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=2,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(v-{v}_{1})(v-{v}_{2}) & =2(v-(3+4\\text{i}))(v-(3-4\\text{i}))\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(v-(3+4\\text{i}))(v-(3-4\\text{i})) & =2({v}^{2}-(3+4\\text{i})v-(3-4\\text{i})v+(3+4\\text{i})(3-4\\text{i})) \\\\  & =2({v}^{2}-(3+4\\text{i}+3-4\\text{i})v+({3}^{2}-{4}^{2}{\\text{i}}^{2})) \\\\  & =2({v}^{2}-6v+(9+16)) \\\\  & =2{v}^{2}-12v+50.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(v)=2{v}^{2}-12v+50.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-46669/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "70c149d8-3739-564c-97c5-6636860ad0c4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-46669"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-107519/selection/88041ade7df65c7c94e022733bb68d31af8f5a6a338a5582b3c743f84d458319" :answer/id #uuid "12bc52a2-ac07-5871-a65a-ad8ed51c6451" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2{y}^{2}+21y-7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107519/selection/eb82244d7b7bcf0e30ffc44c0e8fee657dc887c63c3dd9bf0242b0852b2fa54b" :answer/id #uuid "c3104e83-aae6-5312-af9a-2d023fa95c81" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2{y}^{2}+21y+7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107519/selection/2bcb2e673dc8b6e8b48052bfe7c6ea6907a86c3e304e208ceabcdd0f264c98bb" :answer/id #uuid "00f2a2ff-032e-55cf-994e-158f00cc4675" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2{y}^{2}-28y-98" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107519/selection/ede56dd640cc63a36c5a276866b37536b785e4be75f52831c611727d28617265" :answer/id #uuid "83cdde23-a9ec-513f-a326-849c6e4118a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2{y}^{2}+28y-98" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107519/selection/4180a614449bc5b2de892ab292e5831df6f2645532fa5053ffd47e252de4dd8f" :answer/id #uuid "8dc24f79-3457-5d26-b64c-1bd059e1b603" 